Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:05:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/37] fix(transportd): CK-0002 operation-specific default
 deadlines (incl. Responses streaming budget)

default_deadline_for: compact 1300s, Responses/downloads 3600s, others
300s. Missing caller deadline never truncates before official adapter
timeout; Responses gets the WS streaming budget (GLM-0004). Adds
default_operation_deadline tests.

(cherry picked from commit 118dfd5d118504317bc41d9f0a1ff991844c031c)
